This file is a mirror of the checksums.sha256 file computed from the code-server GitHub release .deb files.
It contains only a list of cryptographic checksums and is not a copyrightable work.
The REUSE specification requires licensing information for every file, so we declare
no copyright and use the project license as a formality.

